"f2853b0e4c": "Why is the choghadiya different in every city?",
"4283b06557": "The day (sunrise to sunset) and the night (sunset to the next sunrise) are each divided into eight equal parts; each part is one choghadiya. Amrit, Shubh and Labh are auspicious, Char is neutral, and Rog, Kaal and Udveg are considered inauspicious.",
